&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;For further development and expansion of our successful business, Raisin is looking for a highly motivated, driven, and experienced &lt;strong&gt;Director of Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; to lead both strategically and operationally our Investment and Pension (IPP) teams (25+ engineers)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This embraces high-quality conceptual and delivery performance of the teams, the health of the IPP engineering organization and system landscape,&amp;nbsp; an efficient and compliant development process, technical and business ownership of the Raisin’s IPP platform, and vendor relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we work in a domain driven organization with a binary-star leadership model. In this model, every Director of Engineering has a Product partner (Head of Product/ Director of Product).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director Engineering (DE) leads both strategically and operationally across multiple cross-functional teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This embraces the six impact areas (in details below):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery quality and speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team and culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process and compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery quality and speed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The DE is:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;accountable for fulfilling the agreed team commitments to their business-owners in time, scope, and budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;responsible for the performance of their teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;resolving impediments for their teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;nurturing a culture of accountability, pragmatism, and reusability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ensuring a strong delivery oriented collaboration between the different engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;leading both complex technical and important business projects&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;leading internal software engineering projects and initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The DE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;drives long-term value creation for their domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;is fostering an environment of passion and fun for the business processes in their tribe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;builds resilient domain expertise in their teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;has a deep understanding of the existing system landscape of their teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;collaborates closely with their Business Owner and other stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;vendor management (evaluating, onboarding, and managing vendors)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The DE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;shapes the technical strategy for their teams according to the Raisin&#39;s business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;collaborates closely with other Sr. Engineering Leads in shaping and implementing Raisin&#39;s Tech Strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;actively initiates and contributes to strategic technical and architectural decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;is always considering the strategic benefits and price of:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;keeping an existing technical solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;introducing a new alternative (e.g framework, tech stack, tooling, process)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team and Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The DE is:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fully responsible for the health, resilience high performance, and development of their teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;offering direct leadership of engineering leads and sometimes also tech leads as well&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;encouraging accountability, creativity, risk-taking, and ownership by delegating responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;attracting, hiring, and retaining top technical talent for Raisin from around the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;proactively mentoring and coaching individual team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ensuring a strong delivery-oriented collaboration between the different engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;organizing workshops/hackathons&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;representing the company in external tech events advancing Raisin’s tech brand recognition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;shaping and driving knowledge transfer best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;nurturing and protecting our culture of trust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;initiating, owning and nurturing tech initiatives (like guilds, workshops, regular meetups)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;recognizing high performance and rewarding accomplishments within their teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process and Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The DE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;drives, improves, and applies existing Raisin standards and policies, regulation and data privacy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;contributes to an optimal toolchain with a high level of automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;develops, establishes, and continually improves documentation standards for the engineering organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;develops guidelines and best practices to ensure a lean software development process across different product teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;is responsible for the KPI-based reporting for their teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;actively monitors, analyses, and drives initiatives to continuously reduce their teams&#39; technical debt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;You hold a university degree in Computer Science,&amp;nbsp; Engineering, Information Systems, or related fields or have equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;Leadership experience 10y+. You are a senior engineering leader, across projects and teams, with a natural aptitude and passion for growing and developing high-performing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have at least 4y experience in FinTech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain knowledge of Investment products is a strong advantage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong business mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;Strong AWS knowledge, Java, SQL, Kafka or other messaging solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;You are pragmatic and can handle the balance between both taking and delegating the lead in challenging situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;You bring both strong strategic and excellent operational leadership skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;You motivate and inspire by outstanding communication and interpersonal skills, both written and verbal, including communicating technical concepts to non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;You possess solid engineering background and distinct hands-on mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;You are experienced with OKR and KPI-based target agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;You are familiar with architecturally-heavy systems, including designing, implementing, and evolving these system constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;You are fluent in English, knowledge of German or another European language would be a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious Minds. Bold Ideas. Extraordinary Impact&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re transforming financial services through bold innovation and relentless execution. You bring the ideas and drive. We&#39;ll build what&#39;s next — together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Leads installations of technical systems, applications, or process designs for client’s purchased or outsourced technology and business process solutions. Senior member within team supporting clients with managing initial access, map, and transfer data, create process documentation, and train or coordinate training for client users. Troubleshoots complex client issues as they arise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Functions:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Capability to apply abstract reuse patterns to integrations and code both on platform and elsewhere using one or more nCino supported languages&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to manipulate how Salesforce leverages, utilizes, and generates nCino supported languages&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Provide technical assistance and leadership for medium-to-large financial institutions and Implementation Service Consultants when building integrations into the nCino/Force.com platform using the nCino Integration Framework.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Begin to co-lead integrations from third-party systems into the nCino platform using any number of technical solutions based on the desired and proper approach for each unique project.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Document process and procedure to help streamline integration methodology.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Build and document testing requirements for unique projects.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Provide solution and integration development with Salesforce.com including requirements, functional specs, design, custom development, integration, testing and deployment.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Evaluate vendor API and interface specifications.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Handle multiple projects effectively while continuing to deliver exceptional quality.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Work independently and prioritize time and projects appropriately.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Translate customer requirements into implementation plans.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Drive customer success with a team player attitude.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Design a salesforce solution that meets the needs of the customer.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Effectively track time and bill for hours worked on customer projects.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Assist sales and sales engineering on technical prospect calls when required.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Leverage AI/ML capabilities to enhance integration frameworks, solution design, system automation, and operational efficiency.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Support the responsible use of AI-driven approaches in cloud-based solutions, DevOps practices, and Salesforce architecture to drive customer success and innovation.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Stay informed on emerging AI technologies and assist the team in identifying opportunities for scalable and secure AI integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Typically requires a minimum of 8 years of related experience/ proficiency with a bachelor’s degree; or 6 years and a Master’s / Advanced degree; or equivalent work experience (as applicable). Some barriers to entry exist at this level, requiring department review.&#39;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to design, build, articulate and defend architectural designs, primarily around integrations, but including some basic UI components and designs&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to support a dev ops process and build solutions with various software development practices&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Able to apply engineering principles to code, flow, and integration patterns including on and off platform tools&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to document more complex solutions and customer facing documentation for work performed&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Salesforce Dev401 certification&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong research, analytical and creative problem-solving skills.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Advanced knowledge of data management, SQL and RDBMS technologies.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience using ETL/integration platforms&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Financial Services experience.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience with Salesforce.com developer toolkit IDE, Migration Tool, Web Services.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Exposure to Salesforce.com configuration and custom development.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Excellent understanding of object-oriented concepts and design patterns, as well as prior work with object-oriented languages&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Large FI experience, particularly with the Loan Origination/Servicing Systems, Enterprise Architecture framework&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Informatica experience.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience with Apex, SOQL, XML, JavaScript.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Salesforce System Architect.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Object-oriented languages such as Java, Ruby, C#, C++.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;ETL/integration platforms such as Cast Iron, Informatica, SnapLogic, etc.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong presentation and communication skills.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong customer and professional skills.&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Position may require some travel&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The pay range for this role is based on relative market data and alignment with our compensation philosophy. The range displayed reflects the minimum and maximum of the pay range for each job posting, which is used to determine new hire rates/salaries and takes into consideration multiple factors including but not limited to knowledge, skills, abilities, proficiencies, experience, education, &lt;span class=&quot;WGI1&quot;&gt;licensures/certifications,&lt;/span&gt; as well as business and organizational needs. nCino reserves the right to modify the posted range consistent with our internal practices and external market movement. The recruiter for this job posting can share more compensation details during the recruitment process, as base salary is only one component of the total compensation package per position posted.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this job is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€76.400&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€126.100 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;nCino provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, protected veteran status, disability, genetics or other protected groups. In addition to federal law requirements, nCino complies with applicable state and local laws governing nondiscrimination in employment in every location in which the company has facilities. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;nCino is committed to the full inclusion of all qualified individuals. As part of this commitment, nCino will ensure that persons with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations. If reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and/or to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, please contact us at &lt;a ----- -----
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to inclusion and equality includes a strong belief that the diversity of our team is instrumental to our success.&amp;nbsp; We strive to create workplaces where employees are empowered to bring their authentic selves to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
