&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join a high-performing sales team within the DACH sales organization, responsible for driving growth within large global enterprises from the Retail &amp;amp; CPG industry. Retail &amp;amp; CPG is one of our strategic industries, where we help global leaders optimize their end-to-end processes, increase operational efficiency through our Process Intelligence platform, and provide the contextual layer to industrialize Enterprise AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Applying a value-driven consultative sales approach, you will create and cultivate strategic relationships to drive sales cycles from deep discovery to value realization. You will be responsible for a selected portfolio of strategic accounts from the Retail &amp;amp; CPG industry headquartered in Germany, generating new business opportunities with existing customers. Navigating complex organizations up to the C-suite, you will collaborate cross-functionally to understand your accounts’ needs and systematically drive the end-to-end sales cycle to a successful close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage your accounts&lt;/strong&gt; from an&lt;strong&gt; existing customer perspective&lt;/strong&gt;, land-and-expand is the typical model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage cross line-of-business at C-level and below&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Celonis Process Intelligence sales motions &lt;strong&gt;across the entire core enterprise value chain, &lt;/strong&gt;translating core challenges into &lt;strong&gt;compelling, AI-enabled use cases &lt;/strong&gt;that deliver&lt;strong&gt; measurable execution capacity &lt;/strong&gt;against &lt;strong&gt;strategic customer pain points.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold an individual revenue target for closing six-seven-figure deals within your accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage closely with partners e.g, consulting firms and SaaS vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive complex sales cycles through orchestrating virtual teams including business development representatives, marketing managers, partner managers, sales engineers / pre-sales, customer success managers, professional services, implementation partners…&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years of relevant experience&lt;/strong&gt; in either one - or ideally both - of the following domains:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;○&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;SaaS Sales:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of applying a consultative sales approach to sell complex, strategic business solutions to large enterprise accounts with full account ownership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;○&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;AI / Management Consulting:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in a (boutique) consultancy, driving AI projects with direct responsibility for account management, client relationships, business development / client acquisition and carrying your own net new revenue quota&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of commitment, long tenure, and &lt;strong&gt;successful career progression &lt;/strong&gt;with your previous companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;business acumen &lt;/strong&gt;and a deep understanding of &lt;strong&gt;core processes&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;KPIs&lt;/strong&gt; throughout the entire enterprise value chain in the retail &amp;amp; CPG industry, particularly within the domains of Finance and Supply Chain.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of the &lt;strong&gt;Retail &amp;amp; CPG industry.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven ability to build trusted relationships with senior Business and IT stakeholders and engage effectively at the C-level (CFO, CIO, COO, VP Operations etc.)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grit&lt;/strong&gt;, a&lt;strong&gt; hands-on mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;strong discovery&lt;/strong&gt; and&lt;strong&gt; sales process leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in German and English, with exceptional communication and presentation skills to engage and excite stakeholders effectively at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt to a fast moving, ever changing, high growth environment and approach challenges with positivity, creative thinking, and a growth mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to be collaborative, inclusive, to embrace diversity and to have strong interpersonal skills #differentmakesusbetter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to leverage internal resources and work as a team #bestteamwins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
